{"seq":2,"slug":"buy-now-hybrid-auction","title":"一口价与拍卖混合：买断期权与并发串行化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/buy-now-hybrid-auction","wordCount":1947,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"一口价与拍卖混合-买断期权与并发串行化\">一口价与拍卖混合：买断期权与并发串行化</h1><p>纯拍卖对卖家有一个结构性风险：整场可能无人出价。对买家也有一个痛点：想立刻拿到货，却必须等到落槌。把「一口价（Buy It Now / buyout）」和拍卖并置，就是同时给两侧提供一个放弃等待的出口。代价是系统里从此存在两类互斥的成交路径，它们必须争抢同一件标的——这是本章唯一真正困难的工程问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>买断期权在机制设计里叫 buyout option：卖家设定一个买断价，任何竞买人在拍卖结束前接受该价即立刻结束拍卖、赢得标的；若无人使用，则由常规出价的最高者中标（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auction#Auction_variants\">Wikipedia, Auction</a>）。这个定义里藏着三个必须显式建模的变量：<strong>买断价是否固定</strong>、<strong>买断权是否永久</strong>、以及<strong>买断与出价之间的优先级</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[上架] --&gt; B{买断权形态}&#10;  B --&gt;|立即买断| C[只有一口价&lt;br/&gt;无出价通道]&#10;  B --&gt;|永久买断| D[出价与买断并存]&#10;  B --&gt;|首出价前买断| E[第一笔出价后&lt;br/&gt;买断权失效]&#10;  D --&gt; F{并发冲突}&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt;|先到| G[买断成交]&#10;  F --&gt;|先到| H[出价成交路径]&#10;  G --&gt; I[拍卖终态]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">graph TD\n  A[上架] --&gt; B{买断权形态}\n  B --&gt;|立即买断| C[只有一口价&lt;br/&gt;无出价通道]\n  B --&gt;|永久买断| D[出价与买断并存]\n  B --&gt;|首出价前买断| E[第一笔出价后&lt;br/&gt;买断权失效]\n  D --&gt; F{并发冲突}\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt;|先到| G[买断成交]\n  F --&gt;|先到| H[出价成交路径]\n  G --&gt; I[拍卖终态]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>三种形态对后端的要求完全不同：只有一口价时不需要出价状态机；永久买断需要长期维护两条路径的互斥；「首出价前买断」则在第一笔出价到来时触发一次不可逆的权限撤销。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>形态</th>\n<th>买断权有效期</th>\n<th>买断价可否变更</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立即买断</td>\n<td>直到被购买</td>\n<td>可下调</td>\n<td>库存清货，等价于纯固定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>永久买断</td>\n<td>直到落槌或被人买断</td>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td>通用商品，兼顾急客与竞拍客</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首出价前买断</td>\n<td>仅到首笔出价之前</td>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td>想让出价者主导、避免急客截胡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"买断价的定价逻辑\">买断价的定价逻辑</h2><p>买断价不是随便在起拍价上乘个系数。它服务于一个明确的取舍：卖家牺牲掉「竞价可能冲得更高」的上行收益，换取「立刻确定成交」的下行保障。</p>\n<h3 id=\"买家为何接受买断\">买家为何接受买断</h3><p>在估值存在不确定、且等待有成本的环境里，买家愿意为「确定性」付费。学界把这一支解释为对风险厌恶与不耐心的补偿：时间压力下的既有偏好可以反过来让拍卖人受益（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dutch_auction\">Wikipedia, Dutch auction</a>，引用关于 buy-it-now 定价的研究）。工程含义是买断价必须与<strong>剩余时间</strong>联动——距落槌越近，愿意支付溢价的买家越少，一个恒定的买断价会在后半场变成无人问津的死参数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卖家为何设置买断\">卖家为何设置买断</h3><p>设置买断等于卖出一份看涨期权：买家付的溢价就是期权费。合理定价的实操准则是让买断价落在「保留价之上、期望落槌价的一个上分位」，既高于保守预期，又不至于高到没人碰。若买断价低于期望落槌价，理性买家会立刻买断，拍卖退化为固定价销售——这正是「立即买断」形态的极端情形。</p>\n<h3 id=\"买断价与动态调价\">买断价与动态调价</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;listing_id&quot;: &quot;L-98231&quot;,&#10;  &quot;buyout&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;price&quot;: 480.0,&#10;    &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;,&#10;    &quot;validity&quot;: &quot;until_first_bid&quot;,&#10;    &quot;revocable&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;auto_reprice&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;rule&quot;: &quot;decay_linear&quot;,&#10;      &quot;min_price&quot;: 420.0,&#10;      &quot;step&quot;: 10.0,&#10;      &quot;interval_hours&quot;: 6&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;guard&quot;: { &quot;buyout_must_exceed_reserve&quot;: true }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"listing_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L-98231\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"buyout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">480.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"validity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"until_first_bid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"revocable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"auto_reprice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"decay_linear\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_price\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">420.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"step\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"interval_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"guard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buyout_must_exceed_reserve\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><em>guard</em> 这条校验不是可选的：买断价低于保留价会让「买断胜出」违反保留价约束，形成一条绕过卖家底线的成交路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"调价必须生成新版本而非就地覆盖\">调价必须生成新版本而非就地覆盖</h3><p>买断价的自动下调（时效衰减）会让「用户看到的买断价」在一天之内变化多次。若就地覆盖同一个字段，事后无法回答「买家当时看到的到底是哪个价」。因此每次调价应当落一条不可变的版本记录：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>buyout_version</code></td>\n<td>单调递增，与买家确认时的版本对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>effective_from</code> / <code>effective_to</code></td>\n<td>该价格的生效区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>changed_by</code></td>\n<td><code>seller</code> / <code>auto_reprice</code> / <code>policy</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>买断请求必须携带它确认的价格版本：若提交时的版本已过期，请求应被拒绝并要求用户以新价格重新确认，而不是静默按最新价成交。这与交易系统里「下单确认价与结算价必须一致」是同一条纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"买断与出价的并发冲突\">买断与出价的并发冲突</h2><p>这是本章的核心难题。买断是「一次性、全量、立即结束」的操作，出价是「可并发、增量、可能来自代理」的操作，两者共享同一个终态。任何允许它们交错提交而不用单一真相源裁决的实现，都会出现「拍卖已买断成交，同时代理出价又把价格抬了一档」的双成交事故。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用条件写入把裁决交给存储\">用条件写入把裁决交给存储</h3><p>最简可靠的做法是把拍卖行视为一个带版本号的聚合根，所有成交路径都走同一个条件更新：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE auction&#10;   SET status = &#39;sold&#39;,&#10;       winner_id = :actor,&#10;       final_price = :price,&#10;       close_reason = :reason,&#10;       version = version + 1&#10; WHERE auction_id = :id&#10;   AND version = :expected_version&#10;   AND status = &#39;running&#39;&#10;   AND close_time &gt; now();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       winner_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :actor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       final_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       close_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :reason,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'running'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> close_time </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>影响行数为 1 才有资格继续后续结算；为 0 说明有人抢先，调用方必须重新读取状态并放弃本次操作。<code>close_time &gt; now()</code> 这一条同时是反狙击延时的守卫——延时会把 <code>close_time</code> 改大，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/anti-sniping-time-extend\">反狙击自动延时</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代理出价的特殊处理\">代理出价的特殊处理</h3><p>代理出价不能简单地「读最高价、加一档、写回」，因为两个并发代理会读到同一个旧价。正确做法是把买断检查放进代理引擎的同一次条件更新里：先尝试满足买断门槛，再走增量加价，见 <a href=\"../proxy-bid-anti-snipe/proxy-bidding-agent\">代理出价（proxy bid）机制</a>。代理的加价若刚好越过买断价，应在同一事务内直接判定为买断，而不是把价格抬到买断价之上再等买家手动接受。</p>\n<h3 id=\"撤回买断权的一次性语义\">撤回买断权的一次性语义</h3><p>买断权在「首出价前有效」的形态下会被一次不可逆的权限撤销终止。这个撤销必须与首笔出价发生在同一个事务里，否则会出现「出价已生效、买断权仍在」的窗口——此时买家的买断请求会被接受，而拍卖已经进入了竞价轨道。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH first_bid AS (&#10;  INSERT INTO bid (auction_id, bidder_id, amount, kind)&#10;  SELECT :id, :actor, a.start_price, &#39;manual&#39;&#10;    FROM auction a&#10;   WHERE a.auction_id = :id&#10;     AND a.status = &#39;running&#39;&#10;     AND a.version = :expected_version&#10;     AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM bid b WHERE b.auction_id = a.auction_id&#10;                      AND b.withdrawn_at IS NULL)&#10;  RETURNING bid_id&#10;)&#10;UPDATE auction&#10;   SET version = version + 1,&#10;       buyout_available = false,&#10;       buyout_revoked_at = now(),&#10;       buyout_revoked_reason = &#39;first_bid&#39;&#10; WHERE auction_id = :id&#10;   AND EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM first_bid);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_bid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid (auction_id, bidder_id, amount, kind)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id, :actor, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">start_price</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'manual'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'running'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :expected_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bid b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auction_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">withdrawn_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RETURNING bid_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       buyout_available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       buyout_revoked_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       buyout_revoked_reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'first_bid'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> auction_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first_bid);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>buyout_revoked_reason</code> 这个字段是审计用的：它让事后能区分「买断权因首笔出价自动撤销」与「卖家手动关闭买断」两种情形，二者的客服话术完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合形态的终态与对账\">混合形态的终态与对账</h2><h3 id=\"终态集合\">终态集合</h3><p>无论走哪条路径，拍卖最终必须落入一个且仅一个终态。把终态枚举写死在 schema 里，而不是散落在业务分支中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;close_reason&quot;: [&quot;hammer&quot;, &quot;buyout&quot;, &quot;reserve_not_met&quot;, &quot;no_bid&quot;, &quot;seller_cancelled&quot;, &quot;fraud_void&quot;],&#10;  &quot;invariant&quot;: &quot;one listing -&gt; exactly one close_reason&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"close_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hammer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reserve_not_met\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_bid\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller_cancelled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fraud_void\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"invariant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"one listing -> exactly one close_reason\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"对账\">对账</h3><p>两条成交路径意味着两条对账口径：买断成交没有出价序列，靠的是单条买断事件；落槌成交靠的是出价事件流重放。日终对账必须能分别覆盖二者，并交叉验证「买断成交的商品其出价序列为空或全部早于买断时刻」。这条不变量是最有效的双成交探测器。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对账项</th>\n<th>落槌成交</th>\n<th>买断成交</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依据事件</td>\n<td>出价序列重放</td>\n<td>单条 buyout 事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格来源</td>\n<td>次高价 + 增量</td>\n<td>买断价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留价校验</td>\n<td>成交价 ≥ 保留价</td>\n<td>定价时校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>常见异常</td>\n<td>序列空洞、乱序</td>\n<td>与出价并存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>买断是一份看涨期权，卖家收溢价、买家买确定性；定价必须与剩余时间联动。</li>\n<li>三种形态（立即 / 永久 / 首出价前）决定了需要维护状态机的复杂度。</li>\n<li>买断价必须高于保留价，否则会出现绕过底线的成交路径。</li>\n<li>买断与出价的唯一可靠裁决方式是带版本号与状态谓词的条件写入，影响行数决定归属。</li>\n<li>终态枚举必须封闭且唯一，日终对账要能区分两条路径并交叉验证互斥性。</li>\n<li>代理出价越过买断门槛时应在同一事务内直接判为买断，而不是先抬价再等待。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一口价与拍卖混合：买断期权与并发串行化","id":"一口价与拍卖混合-买断期权与并发串行化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"买断价的定价逻辑","id":"买断价的定价逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"买家为何接受买断","id":"买家为何接受买断"},{"level":3,"text":"卖家为何设置买断","id":"卖家为何设置买断"},{"level":3,"text":"买断价与动态调价","id":"买断价与动态调价"},{"level":3,"text":"调价必须生成新版本而非就地覆盖","id":"调价必须生成新版本而非就地覆盖"},{"level":2,"text":"买断与出价的并发冲突","id":"买断与出价的并发冲突"},{"level":3,"text":"用条件写入把裁决交给存储","id":"用条件写入把裁决交给存储"},{"level":3,"text":"代理出价的特殊处理","id":"代理出价的特殊处理"},{"level":3,"text":"撤回买断权的一次性语义","id":"撤回买断权的一次性语义"},{"level":2,"text":"混合形态的终态与对账","id":"混合形态的终态与对账"},{"level":3,"text":"终态集合","id":"终态集合"},{"level":3,"text":"对账","id":"对账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"英式、荷式与密封拍卖：四种标准机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/english-dutch-sealed-format"},"next":{"title":"起拍价、保留价与加价幅度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-format-engine/start-reserve-bid-increment"}}